1
00:00:00,488 --> 00:00:02,368
(Sheldon:)I sent out a very emphatic Twitter.

2
00:00:02,532 --> 00:00:06,322
I changed my Facebook status to "Sheldon
wishes Penny would leave him alone."

3
00:00:06,494 --> 00:00:08,204
(Sheldon:)I don't know what else to do.

4
00:00:08,997 --> 00:00:10,997
(Leonard:)Well, what am I supposed to do?

5
00:00:11,166 --> 00:00:13,496
(Sheldon:)If you don't figure something out,
I warn you...

6
00:00:13,668 --> 00:00:17,008
(Sheldon:)...I shall become very difficult
to live with.

7
00:00:18,047 --> 00:00:23,007
(Leonard:)You mean, up until now we've been
experiencing the happy fun-time Sheldon?

8
00:00:23,178 --> 00:00:25,638
(Sheldon:)- Yes.
- I'll go talk to her.

9
00:00:27,348 --> 00:00:29,888
(Penny:)No, Fritz, I need you on my flank.

10
00:00:30,226 --> 00:00:31,356
(Penny:)No, I don't know German.

11
00:00:31,519 --> 00:00:32,689
[SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY]

12
00:00:33,772 --> 00:00:34,902
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

13
00:00:36,399 --> 00:00:38,529
- Hey, Penny?
- Busy.

14
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:41,360
(Leonard:)Yeah, I see that.
Shouldn't you be at work?

15
00:00:41,529 --> 00:00:42,909
(Penny:)I don't work on Mondays.

16
00:00:43,364 --> 00:00:45,114
(Leonard:)It's Thursday.

17
00:00:47,368 --> 00:00:51,578
(Leonard:)- Listen, Penny...
- Ugh. Queen Penelope AFK. What?

18
00:00:54,042 --> 00:00:55,622
Okay. Uh...

19
00:00:55,877 --> 00:00:56,917
(Leonard:)Here's the thing.

20
00:00:57,086 --> 00:01:01,336
(Leonard:)Um, sometimes people, good people,
you know, they start playing these games.

